<title>USA: Consulier Engineering Inc Q1 net falls.</title>
<headline>Consulier Engineering Inc Q1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>TEQUESTA, Fla. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p>Net revenues	    $  844,107		$  797,644</p>
<p>Gross profit	    $  350,155		$  274,966</p>
<p>Operating loss	  $  (62,907)	     $  (36,050)</p>
<p>General &amp;</p>
<p>administrative</p>
<p> expense		  $  383,658		$  265,668</p>
<p>Research &amp;</p>
<p>development</p>
<p> expense		  $   29,404		$   45,348</p>
<p>Investment income     $  299,901		$  377,797</p>
<p>Net income		$  183,438		$  266,586</p>
<p>Average number of</p>
<p>common and common</p>
<p>equivalent shares</p>
<p> outstanding	     2,523,125		 2,516,203</p>
<p>Earnings per shr	$	.07		$	.11</p>
<p>NOTE: Company said lower net income was due to higher selling, general and adminstrative expenses related to the introduction of its new product, CRA-Z Soap Hand Cleaner, to the national market.</p>
